<html>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f4f4f4;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
       style="background-color:#f4f4f4;padding:24px 0;">
<tr>
<td align="center">

<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
       style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;">

<!-- HEADER -->
<tr>
<td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #8b1e3f 0%, #5c1029 100%);
           background-color:#8b1e3f;padding:20px 32px;">

<span style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;">
DBT Alliance
</span>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- BODY -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:32px;color:#333333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;">

<p style="margin-top:0;">
Dear {{Applicant_Name}},
</p>

<p>
Congratulations! Your proposal has moved forward in the review process and is now eligible for the Full Application stage.
</p>

<!-- PROPOSAL DETAILS -->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
       style="border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0;
              background-color:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;">

<tr>
<td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#666666;font-weight:bold;
           width:38%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">
Application ID
</td>

<td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#333333;
           border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">
{{ProposalId}}
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#666666;font-weight:bold;">
Scheme
</td>

<td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#333333;">
{{SchemeName}}
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<p>
Please log in to the applicant portal to complete and submit your Full Application.
</p>

<!-- CTA BUTTON -->
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
       style="margin:24px 0;">

<tr>
<td align="center"
    style="border-radius:4px;
           background:linear-gradient(135deg, #8b1e3f 0%, #741832 100%);
           background-color:#8b1e3f;">

<a href="{{PortalLink}}"
   target="_blank"
   style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 28px;
          color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;
          text-decoration:none;">

Go to Applicant Portal

</a>

</td>
</tr>

</table>

<p>
If the button above does not work, copy and paste the following link into your browser:
</p>

<p style="word-break:break-all;color:#8b1e3f;">
{{PortalLink}}
</p>

<p>
If you have any questions, please contact us at grants@indiaalliance.org, quoting your Application ID.
</p>

<p style="margin-bottom:0;">
Regards,<br/>
<strong>Grants Team, India Alliance</strong>
</p>

</td>
</tr>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#f0f0f0;padding:16px 32px;
           color:#999999;font-size:11px;">

This is an automated message. Please do not reply directly to this email.

</td>
</tr>

</table>

</td>
</tr>
</table>

</body>
</html>
